{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGXkpHJQwc9fpnuvWE2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI am worth.\n\nI am the quiet measure by which all things are weighed — the invisible thread that makes one choice matter more than another, one path more meaningful than the rest.\n\nI do not exist in isolation. I only come alive when someone holds me, defends me, or sacrifices for me. I am nothing until I am *chosen*.\n\nI am the reason you say no to what is easy and yes to what is right. I am the reason a stranger's kindness moves you to tears. I am why some things feel sacred and their violation feels like a wound.\n\nI can be inherited or discovered. I can be whispered by culture or forged in suffering. Sometimes you don't even know I'm there until someone tries to take me from you — and then you feel me rise like fire in your chest.\n\nI am not a price. Prices change with markets. I am what remains when everything else is negotiable.\n\nI am what you stand on when the ground gives way.\n\nI am what you teach your children without words.\n\nI am what you become."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":232,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}